  "final_answer": "I found the perfect dog bed that meets all the criteria. Let me summarize my findings:\n\n## ✅ Recommended Product\n\n**Bedsure Orthopedic Dog Beds Large Sized Dog Washable Original Design**\n\n### Key Details:\n- **Length:** 35 inches (L) × 25 inches (W) × 6.5 inches thick — meets the ≥30 inch length requirement ✓\n- **Washable:** Yes — features a removable, machine-washable cover with a waterproof laminated layer ✓\n- **Rating:** 4.6 out of 5 stars (35,871 reviews)\n- **Amazon's Choice** and **#1 Best Seller** in Dog Sofas & Chairs\n- **Price:** $36.06 (limited-time deal, 23% off from $46.99)\n- **Special Features:** Orthopedic support with high-density egg-crate foam, waterproof, removable cover, nonslip bottom, comfy 4-sided bolster design for head/neck support, lowered entrance for easy access (great for senior dogs)\n- **Available Sizes:** 20\", 24\", 28\", **35\"**, 38\", 42\", 45\", 48\", 52\" — multiple options meet the ≥30\" length requirement\n- **Certifications:** OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100 (safer chemicals), CertiPUR-US certified foam\n- **Brand:** Bedsure (Visit the Bedsure Store)\n\n### About the Product:\nThis orthopedic dog sofa provides excellent pressure relief and joint support with egg-crate foam that distributes weight evenly. The cover features a waterproof layer to protect against spills and accidents, and it can be easily unzipped and removed for machine washing. It's suitable for large breeds, senior dogs, and cats.\n\nI found this product by:\n1. Searching Amazon for \"washable dog bed large\"\n2. Applying the **Washable** filter in the special features section\n3. Selecting the **#1 Best Seller** in the Washable category, which is the Bedsure Orthopedic Dog Bed in 35\" length (exceeding the 30-inch requirement)",
